# Build config for the portal (non-secret).
# Clerk publishable keys are public by design — they ship inside the bundle —
# so this lives in the repo rather than in a build-environment variable that
# can go missing on a rename. pk_live_* is the clerk.gavinf.com instance,
# shared with homecloud so a session carries across the subdomains.
PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_Y2xlcmsuZ2F2aW5mLmNvbSQ
